2. Inputs (per cell; asserted by the script, never assumed)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

For each of the 16 (tag, split) cells:
    results/rf_preds_{tag}_{split}.npz              RF test predictions
    results/gnn_preds_{tag}_gine_{split}.npz        GINE seed 42
    results/gnn_preds_{tag}_gine_{split}_seed1.npz  GINE seed 1
    results/gnn_preds_{tag}_gine_{split}_seed2.npz  GINE seed 2

= 16 RF npz + 48 GINE npz = 64 input files.  The script checks test_idx
alignment between the RF and GINE npz before bootstrapping.

No model was trained: the bootstrap resamples test MOLECULES with
replacement (paired resample index matrix applied to both models).

